[6.445, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[J\u001b[31A  directory (e.g., \u001b[94m$HOME\u001b[m, which is a one-click preset in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8c5e7ef5f71647ac;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/project_dialog.dart#L189-L194\u0007ProjectDialog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), \u001b[94mlistSync()\u001b[m can stall UI rendering.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m## 4. UI / UX & Code Quality Observations\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mMessage Feed Scroll Behavior\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc1953b583b8ab667;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L98-L116\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 uses a \u001b[94mListView.builder\u001b[m without a \u001b[94mScrollController\u001b[m. As tokens stream\r\n  into a long Markdown or A2UI message, the viewport does not automatically scroll to keep the latest content in view.\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mDuplicate Typing Indicator\u001b[m: While chunks are actively streaming into an assistant \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3a0f40fa7eaecf4d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L17\u0007MessageBubble\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94"]
