[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m\u25cb\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 2m 38s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Test coverage should be added to `test/widget_test.dart` to verify the sandbox escape path de...)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(main.dart)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(chat_view_model.dart)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m\u2026 15 more actions (3 reads, 12 edits) \u2026\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(widget_test.dart)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(dart analyze && flutter test)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  I have resolved the identified issues and added test coverage:\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Summary of Fixes\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mEnabled Automatic A2UI Surface Action & Outbound RPC Forwarding in Production (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6fe90bcda2259de0;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/main.dart#L21-L27\u0007m\u001b[22main.dart:21-27\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m:\n\u001b[95D\u2022 Configured the default \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4d257c4e83030ac2;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L20\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 i"]
[0.0, "o", "n \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk90228a2147e6cc7a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/main.dart#L12\u0007MarkdownChatApp\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with \u001b[94mforwardSurfaceActionsToAgent: true\u001b[m and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mforwardRpcMessagesToAgent: true\u001b[m so user surface interactions and renderer RPC responses are automatically sent\r\n\u001b[6Cto the Antigravity agent.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mBatched, Stream-Safe Outbound RPC Forwarding (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf8c47bf47ab4f983;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L220-L253\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_view_model.dart:220-253\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m:\n\u001b[75D\u2022 Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6d7a918273339cff;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L235\u0007_enqueueOutboundRpcForForwarding\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd50d9f4ff3497d61;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L256\u0007_flushPendingAutoForwardRpcMessages\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk23bab9dbaeab2d08;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/feat"]
[0.0, "o", "ures/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L773\u0007sendRpcMessagesToAgent\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[6C\u2022 Outbound RPC messages emitted while an assistant reply is still streaming are queued and flushed in a single\r\n\u001b[6Cbatched \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessagePayload\u001b[m turn when the stream completes (\u001b[94monDone\u001b[m), preventing mid-stream\r\n\u001b[6Ccancellation and multi-RPC race conditions.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mPreserved Custom Thread Titles on First Message (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1cf01c8ffa34cace;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L691\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_view_model.dart:691\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m:\n\u001b[74D\u2022 Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4a2103fbd18edea4;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L667\u0007ChatViewModel.sendMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to check \u001b[94m!current.isAutoTitled\u001b[m so explicitly renamed empty threads keep\r\n\u001b[6Ctheir custom title when the first message is sent.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mHardened Sandbox-Escape Path Heuristics (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk65dbe0f555803181;file:///Us"]
